[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12425.11, "timestamp": "03:27:05", "text": "寝ているかもしれないよ。 だから、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12428.71, "timestamp": "03:27:08", "text": "神になる。 午前6時まで待つよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12434.229, "timestamp": "03:27:14", "text": "いや、今日は日曜日、コラボの仕事があるんだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12436.55, "timestamp": "03:27:16", "text": "でも待って、それは7時だよ。大丈夫。 私は午前"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 12437.641, "timestamp": "03:27:17", "author": "@sarthaksharma2476", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kmJohYAdmpQzCNN96t58cLSK8spv6Y2ITutBFF9nvi9Z8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "they dont know you in the house"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12440.63, "timestamp": "03:27:20", "text": "6時か7時に寝て、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12443.83, "timestamp": "03:27:23", "text": "午後に起きます。 ええ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12445.51, "timestamp": "03:27:25", "text": "家の中では誰もあなたのことを知りませんよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12448.07, "timestamp": "03:27:28", "text": "つまり、私は今、2階の自分のオフィス兼"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12458.389, "timestamp": "03:27:38", "text": "、彼らは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12459.91, "timestamp": "03:27:39", "text": "私が階下の自分の部屋にいると思っていたんです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12462.63, "timestamp": "03:27:42", "text": "。   だから、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12468.15, "timestamp": "03:27:48", "text": "普通は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12471.269, "timestamp": "03:27:51", "text": "祖母の家の屋外の入り口を塞いではいけないと思う"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12477.03, "timestamp": "03:27:57", "text": "けど、まあ"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 12479.591, "timestamp": "03:27:59", "author": "@sarthaksharma2476", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kmJohYAdmpQzCNN96t58cLSK8spv6Y2ITutBFF9nvi9Z8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "grandma wake up!! "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12479.75, "timestamp": "03:27:59", "text": "大丈夫だと思う。 私は、私は、ただ待つだけです"}]